{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u><strong>&quot;Unseen&quot; is a first-person thriller with psychological horror elements, featuring a linear narrative and a playtime of approximately 60 to 80 minutes.</strong></u></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Story</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It\u2019s an indie horror game where John, a forensic photographer, after an unexpected and exhausting shift, is forced to spend the night away from home. What seemed like a temporary rest soon begins to turn unsettling.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Gameplay</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is primarily a first-person walking simulator, with elements of exploration, puzzles, and interaction designed to immerse the player in an oppressive and mysterious atmosphere.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085250/extras/ffc60e755330c5cecfa6f2ff9ecdfa06.poster.avif?t=1765497311\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085250/extras/ffc60e755330c5cecfa6f2ff9ecdfa06.webm?t=1765497311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085250/extras/ffc60e755330c5cecfa6f2ff9ecdfa06.mp4?t=1765497311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Game Features</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and unsettling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You\u2019re late","path":"https:/